# Unity-generated folders and files
/[Ll]ibrary/
/[Tt]emp/
/[Oo]bj/
/[Bb]uild/
/[Bb]uilds/
/[Ll]ogs/
/[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
/[Mm]emoryCaptures/
/[Rr]ecordings/
*.csproj
*.sln
*.slnx
*.pidb.meta
*.pdb.meta
*.mdb.meta

# The repo root .gitignore excludes these for the .NET projects, but a Unity project must keep them:
# every asset's .meta file (it holds the asset GUID) and Packages/ (manifest.json, packages-lock.json)
!*.meta
!/Packages/

# Copied in by UltraLiteDB.Benchmarks/run-il2cpp.sh (the library DLL and the benchmark sources)
/Assets/Plugins/UltraLiteDB/
/Assets/Plugins/UltraLiteDB.meta
/Assets/UltraLiteBench/
/Assets/UltraLiteBench.meta
